---
import Slog from "../assets/images/Hero_Content_Tittle2.png"
---

<main id="Hero" class="rounded-bl-[40px] rounded-br-[40px]">
    <div>
        <div class="overlay h-full w-full px-12 py-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row">
            <div
                class="child md:px-10 md:items-center  md:justify-center md:py-7"
            >
            <div class="typho mb-4">
                <h1 class="text-5xl text-primary font-bold font-[PoppinsSemibold]">
                    Temukan Rasa disetiap suapan
                </h1>
                <p class="w-50 md:w-150 font-[Poppins] md:text-left"> 
                   Keripik Cumi GurihPedas menghadirkan sensasi kriuk yang bikin nagih, cita rasa laut yang autentik, dan kebahagiaan di setiap gigitan!,
                   Setiap gigitan memberi sensasi laut yang autentik, seolah kamu sedang menikmati cumi segar langsung dari pantai.
                   Karena bagi kami, kebahagiaan sejati adalah saat kamu tersenyum menikmati lezatnya keripik cumi buatan lokal.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 md:flex-row"> 

                <button
                    class="px-3 py-1.5  rounded-lg text-white "
                >
                <a href="/catalog" class=" decoration-red-600/30">
                    Pesan Sekarang!
                </a>
                </button>
                <span class="text-center italic font-sm">atau</span>
                <button
                    class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-white"
                >
                <a href="https://wa.me/6281327370987" class="decoration-red-600/30">
                    Tanya Penjual
                </a> 
                </button>
            </div>
            </div>
            <div class="child hidden lg:flex">
                <img src={Slog.src}  alt="Slog" />
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</main>

<style>
    
     @font-face {
        font-family: "PoppinsSemiBold";
        src: url("../assets/fonts/Poppins/Poppins-Regular.ttf");
    }
    main {
        background-image: url("../assets/images/Hero_Content_Polos.png"); 
        background-repeat: no-repeat;
        background-size: cover;
        color: #e4e4e4;
    }
    .overlay {
        background-color: hsla(0, 0%, 0%, 0.643);
        height:100vh;
    }
    button {
        font-family: "PoppinsSemiBold";
        background-color: #561306;
    }
    button:hover{
        background-color: #E4E4E4;
       
        color:#561306;
    }
</style>
